<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BA Merchant on recommended list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BA Merchant on recommended list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said analyst Gregory Gould initiated coverage of BA Merchant Services Inc, and added the company to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- analyst not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/4 to 17-5/8 in midmorning exchange trade.</p>
